 "remarks": "Welcome home to effortless one-level living on a premier, lush one-acre lot in Darien. Available for the first time in 56 years, this beautifully maintained 4-bedroom, 2.5-bath ranch features a newer roof, windows, and driveway. The large classic footprint spans over 3000sf and allows for easy customization and personal upgrades to make this house your own. This sweet home is nestled in a neighborhood with homes valued up to $6M, which offers endless possibilities for improvements.  The seamless layout flows across classic hardwood floors, anchored by two cozy fireplaces and massive picture windows in the formal living room, dining room, and den. Enjoy a casual eat-in kitchen, formal dining space for holiday gatherings, a large functional laundry room, and an attached 2-car garage with stepless entry directly into the home.  Outside, your expansive private yard offers endless possibilities for entertaining or gardening. Centrally located just minutes from downtown shops, dining, the Darien and Noroton Heights train stations, and top-rated schools. Schedule your private showing today!",
